{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1206","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Make Product Equal One"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"1 second"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"},{"kind":"text","text":":"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You are given $$$n$$$ numbers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$. With a cost of one coin you can perform the following operation:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Choose one of these numbers and add or subtract $$$1$$$ from it."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In particular, we can apply this operation to the same number several times."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"We want to make the product of all these numbers equal to $$$1$$$, in other words, we want $$$a_1 \\cdot a_2$$$ $$$\\dots$$$ $$$\\cdot a_n = 1$$$. "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, for $$$n = 3$$$ and numbers $$$[1, -3, 0]$$$ we can make product equal to $$$1$$$ in $$$3$$$ coins: add $$$1$$$ to second element, add $$$1$$$ to second element again, subtract $$$1$$$ from third element, so that array becomes $$$[1, -1, -1]$$$. And $$$1\\cdot (-1) \\cdot (-1) = 1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"What is the minimum cost we will have to pay to do that?"}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 10^5$$$) — the number of numbers."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$-10^9 \\le a_i \\le 10^9$$$) — the numbers."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output a single number — the minimal number of coins you need to pay to make the product equal to $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Examples"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n-1 1\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4\n0 0 0 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n4"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n-5 -3 5 3 0\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n13"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first example, you can change $$$1$$$ to $$$-1$$$ or $$$-1$$$ to $$$1$$$ in $$$2$$$ coins."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the second example, you have to apply at least $$$4$$$ operations for the product not to be $$$0$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the third example, you can change $$$-5$$$ to $$$-1$$$ in $$$4$$$ coins, $$$-3$$$ to $$$-1$$$ in $$$2$$$ coins, $$$5$$$ to $$$1$$$ in $$$4$$$ coins, $$$3$$$ to $$$1$$$ in $$$2$$$ coins, $$$0$$$ to $$$1$$$ in $$$1$$$ coin."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"B","problemCode":"1206B","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1206/problem/B"}